{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04449","headline":"咏主人壁上画鹤寄乔主簿崔着作 · 陈子昂","name":"咏主人壁上画鹤寄乔主簿崔着作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古壁仙人画，丹青尚有文。\n独舞纷如雪，孤飞暧似云。\n自矜彩色重，宁忆故池羣。\n江海联翩翼，长鸣谁复闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04449.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04449","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}